# Build output. Derived, large, and different on every machine. `/target/` was
# missing, and 950MB of debug rlibs and incremental dep-graphs went in behind
# it — so these are stated by what they are rather than by where they were
# found: `node_modules/` and `dist/` carry no leading slash and match at any
# depth, where naming the chart's two by hand only held until something else
# grew one.
/target/
node_modules/
dist/

# docker-compose's bind-mounted roots: real downloads plus the directory
# tree scripts/seed-dev-fixtures.ts generates. Neither belongs in git.
dev-data/

# Deliberately not ignored, though it is built: `assets/app-<hash>.js` is what
# `include_bytes!` reads at compile time and `build.rs` names, so a checkout
# without it does not compile. Same standing as `assets/app.css`.
